CommitDate: Thu Jun 5 12:38:46 2025 +1200

    Bug 1971060 - Make virtual folders work with the new database. r=BenC
    The main problems here are the virtual folder view going into an infinite loop waiting for message
    databases to be closed, and virtual folders being removed at start-up because they don't exist in
    the profile like real folders. I've temporarily disabled the folder listener which updates virtual
    folders when the real folder hierarchy changes.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D252975

